WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1. Access and secrets
Synthetic training. Use unique local accounts and the least-privilege role that supports the test.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
2. Persistence and backups
Synthetic training. Docker/appliance deployments use PostgreSQL for administration and named volumes for persistent evidence.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
3. Retention and restoration
Synthetic training. Review configured audit, execution and evidence retention plus minimum retained runs.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
4. Evidence sharing and escalation
Synthetic training. Operational outputs may expose hostnames, addresses, UUIDs, user names, task text and topology even when passwords are hidden.
